                <pb facs="0813" n="803" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg803"/>


                <head>(C.)—Admiral Buchanan to Mr. Mallory.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mobile,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 4, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The French consul, M. Portz, has, in his official capacity as acting English
                    consul, introduced me to Mr. Cridland, who has shown me an official document,
                    signed by Lyons, appointing him the acting English consul at Mobile. Am I to
                    recognize him as such?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
